OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGCISKEI FORCES OPEN FIRE
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGON ANC SUPPORTERS
OL,4,D
OL,5, Security forces in the black homeland
OL,6, of Ciskei in South Africa have opened
OL,7, fire on ANC supporters staging a
OL,8, protest against Ciskei's leadership.
OL,10,FA South African official said at least
OL,11,F23 people were killed and 147 injured
OL,12,Fas troops fired on the demonstrators
OL,13,Ffor five minutes.
OL,15,FThe troops opened fire as the AMC march
OL,16,Fwas at a stadium just outside Bisho,
OL,17,Fcapital of Ciskei.
OL,19,FA BBC correspondent said rifle grenades
OL,20,Flanded among the crowd cowering under
OL,21,Fthe hail of live ammunition.
OL,23,D]FFromG07-09-92F  teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,182,180,120,250,0,100
