OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGTRAPPED TAJIKISTAN
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGPRESIDENT RESIGNS
OL,5, President Rahmon Nabiyev of Tajikistan
OL,6, has given way to opposition demands for
OL,7, his resignation.
OL,9,FHe was trapped by armed opposition
OL,10,Fgroups at the airport in the capital,
OL,11,FDushanbe, as he was trying to leave for
OL,12,Fthe northern city of Khajad, a
OL,13,Fstronghold of his supporters.
OL,14,F
OL,15,FTajik television later broadcast
OL,16,Fpictures of Mr Nabiyev, in an airport
OL,17,Flounge, signing a document and
OL,18,Fannouncing his resignation.
OL,19,F
OL,20,FHe was later driven away from the
OL,21,Fairport.
OL,23,D]FFromG07-09-92F  teletextarchive.com
