OL,1,Vk4                               G9/9
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGWILLIS CALLS FOR
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGEMPLOYEES' CHARTER
OL,4,D
OL,5, Trades Union Congress general secretary
OL,6, Norman Willis has called for an
OL,7, Employees' Charter and a commitment to
OL,8, full employment.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FSpeaking on the opening day of the TUC
OL,11,Fconference in Blackpool, he said the
OL,12,FGovernment should not regard workers'
OL,13,Frights as a burden while trying to
OL,14,Fensure citizens' rights.
OL,15,F
OL,16,FHe said the Maastricht treaty on
OL,17,FEuropean union should be ratified to
OL,18,Fprovide social protection.
OL,19,F
OL,20,FIf it is not, there would still be a
OL,21,Fsingle market needing union structures.
OL,22,D
OL,23,D]FFromG07-09-92F  teletextarchive.com
